---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "[DD Month YYYY, set this when you publish]";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Fellowshell collects, uses, and protects personal data."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated-note text-muted">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </header>

      <p>
        This policy explains what personal data Fellowshell ("<strong>we</strong>",
        "<strong>us</strong>") collects through this website and our
        placement service, why we collect it, and the rights you have over
        it. It is written to meet our obligations under the EU/UK General
        Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).
      </p>

      <p class="callout">
        <strong>Before publishing:</strong> replace the remaining bracketed
        placeholders below, and have this reviewed by a lawyer for your
        jurisdiction. This template describes the data practices actually
        implemented in this codebase. Update it if those practices change.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        The data controller for information collected through this site is
        Fellowshell. You can reach us at{" "}
        <a class="link" href="mailto:privacy@fellowshell.com">privacy@fellowshell.com</a>{" "}
        for anything covered by this policy, including a request to a Data
        Protection Officer if one is appointed later.
      </p>

      <h2>2. What we collect, and why</h2>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Data</th>
            <th>Purpose</th>
            <th>Legal basis</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Name, email, company, message content, and any file you attach via the contact form</td>
            <td>Respond to your enquiry; assess fit if you're applying as a volunteer</td>
            <td>Legitimate interest / steps taken at your request prior to a contract</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Email address, if you opt in to updates</td>
            <td>Send occasional news about Fellowshell</td>
            <td>Consent (withdraw anytime via the unsubscribe link)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Cookie consent choice (necessary/analytics)</td>
            <td>Remember your cookie preference so we don't ask again</td>
            <td>Legitimate interest (strictly necessary storage)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Aggregate usage data (pages viewed, approximate location, device type)</td>
            <td>Understand how the site is used and improve it</td>
            <td>Consent (only collected if you accept analytics cookies)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Background, work history, and any application materials (volunteer applicants)</td>
            <td>Assess suitability for the program and match you to real work</td>
            <td>Steps taken at your request prior to a contract</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>3. Cookies and similar storage</h2>
      <p>
        We only set strictly necessary storage by default. Analytics storage
        is off until you actively accept it in the cookie banner, and you can
        change your choice at any time via "Cookie preferences" in the
        footer. Full detail is in our{" "}
        <a class="link" href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Who we share data with</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell personal data. We may share it with:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Client companies, when you apply as a volunteer and are put forward for a specific piece of work (with your knowledge beforehand)</li>
        <li>FormSubmit (formsubmit.co), which delivers contact form submissions, including any attached files, to our inbox by email</li>
        <li>Regulators or authorities where we're legally required to disclose it</li>
      </ul>
      <p>[Add any further processors here as you adopt them, e.g. a hosting provider or analytics vendor.]</p>

      <h2>5. International transfers</h2>
      <p>
        If personal data is transferred outside the EU/UK, we rely on an
        adequacy decision or appropriate safeguards such as Standard
        Contractual Clauses. [Confirm and detail once hosting/processors are
        finalised.]
      </p>

      <h2>6. How long we keep data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact form enquiries: [retention period, e.g. 12 months from last contact]</li>
        <li>Volunteer applications and program records: [retention period, e.g. duration of the program plus a defined period after]</li>
        <li>Cookie consent records: up to 12 months, after which we ask again</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
      <p>Under the GDPR, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
        <li>Correct inaccurate or incomplete data</li>
        <li>Request erasure of your data ("right to be forgotten")</li>
        <li>Restrict or object to certain processing</li>
        <li>Request a portable copy of data you provided to us</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent at any time, where processing relies on consent</li>
        <li>Lodge a complaint with your local data protection supervisory authority</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To exercise any of these rights, email{" "}
        <a class="link" href="mailto:privacy@fellowshell.com">privacy@fellowshell.com</a>.
        We'll respond within one month, as required by law.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Automated decision-making</h2>
      <p>
        We do not use fully automated decision-making or profiling that
        produces legal or similarly significant effects when matching
        volunteers or evaluating enquiries.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Children's data</h2>
      <p>
        This site is intended for business use and is not directed at
        children. We do not knowingly collect data from anyone under 16.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We'll update this page when our practices change and update the
        "last updated" date above. Significant changes will be flagged more
        prominently where appropriate.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy or how your data is handled:{" "}
        <a class="link" href="mailto:privacy@fellowshell.com">privacy@fellowshell.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .callout {
    background: var(--color-accent-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-3);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
</style>
